    },
    "body": "## Summary\n- require a persisted authenticated reporter before job-report creation, withdrawal, or private history access\n- fail closed before touching either job or report persistence for missing/transient principals\n- reuse the validated reporter ID for repository scoping and own-job checks\n- add regression tests covering null/transient principals and zero persistence interactions\n- document the invariant in `docs/SECURITY.md`\n\n## Why\nJob reports are private moderation state. The service previously dereferenced `reporter.getId()` after entering these operations, which could produce an NPE for a missing principal and did not establish the service-level invariant that private report state is inaccessible until a persisted actor identity is proven.\n\n## Validation\nGitHub Actions must pass on the exact PR head before merge. No merge while any relevant check is pending or failing.",
